---
import Township from '../layouts/Township.astro';
---
<Township title="Services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <section id="zoning"><h2>Zoning permits</h2><p>Most changes to a building or lot need a permit first. Download the application from <a href="/documents">Documents</a>, then bring it to the office or email it to us.</p></section>
    <section id="records"><h2>Public records</h2><p>You can ask for public records in person, by mail or by email. You do not need to say why you want them.</p></section>
    <section id="roads"><h2>Roads</h2><p>To report a pothole, a downed tree or a flooded road, call the township office during business hours.</p></section>
    <section id="cemetery"><h2>Cemetery</h2><p>Contact the office for plot availability and burial arrangements.</p></section>
  </div>
</Township>
